; Subroutine: bios_set_cmnd_buffer [#C1B0]
; Tasks:        Extended BIOS &BEA4 SET CMND BUFFER: set the autostart string - CON: input (con_crt_in)
;               takes its characters before the keyboard, as if typed. A -> autostart_flag, 129
;               bytes from HL (length byte + up to 128 characters) -> autostart_count /
;               autostart_string, autostart_ptr = &B052.
