;               A = &FF and HL = &0330 (in the parameter sector loaded to &0300) - after INSTALL "Autostart
;               String" = DIR + &0D the restarted CP/M ran DIR by itself. The Amstrad boot sector
;               (|CPM,1) does not call it.
; Input:        HL = length byte + string, A = flag (0: a key cancels the string)
; Changed:      BC, DE, HL, F
; Called by:    cpm_ext_set_cmnd_buffer (&BE80 extended jumpblock)
bios_set_cmnd_buffer:
