; *** BUGFIX PROPOSAL (todo.md, "Bugfix proposals"): RST &28 = FIRM JUMP has a CPC inline word like
; *** RST &08 / &10 / &18, but its entry says length 1 (byte 0 = &26), so L lists the word as
; *** instructions. Patch: byte 0 at &F5F1 &26 -> &A6 (length 3, as at &F5C1 for RST &18); in the
